{"title":"2012 CEMC Euclid Problems/Problem 6b","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_6\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_CEMC_Euclid_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"2012 CEMC Euclid Problems/Problem 6\">Problem 6</a></span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_CEMC_Euclid_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=T-1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem 6\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_CEMC_Euclid_Problems/Problem_6b&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Determine all real values of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> for which\n</p>\n<center><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/0/c/b0c1a351ef62eb448afceed24f7276e20d314b0d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3^{x+2} + 2^{x+2} + 2^{x} = 2^{x+5} + 3^{x}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"230\" height=\"18\" /></center>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_CEMC_Euclid_Problems/Problem_6b&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/2/0/a20b72f7aee0c6391654464c25f02280a02cfc72.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a^{b + c} = a^{b} \\times a^{c}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"113\" height=\"19\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/b/17bcb65f842f25644bfb790e91bb1172e4d03d08.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{a^{c}}{b^{c}} = (\\frac{a}{b})^{c}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"81\" height=\"38\" />, so we have:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/e/6/7e6dfed0fb771fabe183e922195f81e379b9f266.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3^{x} \\times 3^{2} + 2^{x} \\times 2^{2} + 2^{x} = 2^{x} \\times 2^{5} + 3^{x}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"296\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/f/9/ff96d80823194cd0694c27597d42a66baf8e89d3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$9 \\times 3^{x} + 5 \\times 2^{x} = 32 \\times 2^{x} + 3^{x}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"243\" height=\"16\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/6/e/c6e17682434971fec4e512b86482bb7619268f2e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$8 \\times 3^{x} = 27 \\times 2^{x}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"133\" height=\"16\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/c/0/0c0ebc53e66d716436e37e6dc4c8859a329690a0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{27}{8} = \\frac{3^{x}}{2^{x}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"70\" height=\"38\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/2/2/f220f83783f5ad54abb8ef33672ea05797f3c9c6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(\\frac{3}{2})^{3} = (\\frac{3}{2})^{x}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"96\" height=\"38\" />\n</p><p>Since the bases are equal and aren't equal to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/c/1/bc1f9d9bf8a1b606a4188b5ce9a2af1809e27a89.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, the exponents must be equal, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/d/f/ddf82c45c1241a963ba5e2b4d74780dfa225daa8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{x = 3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"57\" height=\"25\" />.\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017230442\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.010 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.015 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 50/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 78/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2412/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    5.898      1 2012_CEMC_Euclid_Problems/Problem_6\n100.00%    5.898      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:36329:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261017230442 and revision id 281368. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}